# Visualizer PNGs
sdg-merge/pdg_*.png

# The demand-driven pipeline's emitted program. merged.java is committed (the
# merge result, viewable without running); this is the same program produced
# the demand-driven way, written so the harness can compare the two.
examples/corpus/*/merged_scoped.java

# Randomised triples (scratch batch from sdg-merge/fuzz.py)
examples/fuzz/
